    "title": "Speed limit lowering on Mary Patton Highway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WCYB ,\n4 hours ago ELIZABETHTON, Tenn. (WCYB) — The speed limit on Mary Patton Highway in Elizabethton will be lowering, according to city officials . Officials say the request came from city council in a May meeting. The police and street and sanitation departments decided to lower the limit from 50 to 40. Read full article\n2",
